  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Universal Access to Female Condoms 2013-2015 - UAFC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Universal Access to Female Condoms 2013-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmets m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka eferfr&#xe5;gan och utbudet p&#xe5; kvinnliga        kondomer. Ett annat m&#xe5;l att st&#xe4;rka det globala och nationella st&#xf6;det  f&#xf6;r kvinnliga kondomer. Tre pilotl&#xe4;nder- Nigeria, Cameroon och        Mozambique - har identifierats.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to increase the demand and supply   of female condoms. Another objective is to strengthen the global and  national support for female condoms. Three pilot countries - Nigeria, Cameroon and Mozambique - have been identified.</narrative>
  </description>
